## What We Are Building

This session closed a single architectural symptom («Polina не реагирует на pipeline events») that turned out to have **four layered causes**, each masking the next. By the end, the full chain works:

```
Real Inngest agent finishes → factory.ts logEvent(agent_completed)
  → activity_events INSERT
    → Postgres trigger mirrors to concierge_turns (UI chip)
    → logEvent fires inngest 'pa/notify-needed'
      → exec-pa-react (debounce 5s, cap 1)
        → POST /api/concierge/chat-internal (Bearer PA_INTERNAL_TOKEN)
          → buildSystemPrompt(autoReact:true) + AUTO_REACT_GUIDANCE block
          → OpenAI gpt-5.5 non-streaming
          → persistTurn role=assistant metadata.auto_react=true
            → Realtime broadcast OR 15s polling fallback
              → ConciergePanel renders bubble (auto_react branch in Realtime + DB-load)
                → Director sees Polina react ~5-20s after the event, no typing required
```

Parallel achievements in same session:
- Drive layout refactored to `SandyStudio/<series>/<bucket>/<assetType>/<file>` for S15+. S14 untouched per Director directive.
- 13/13 S15 Bible Library files moved into `SandyStudio/SS-S15/bible/images/` via Drive API parent-update.
- Bible image aspect-ratio policy fixed (was hardcoded 1024×1024 → section-aware: characters/objects square, locations/style landscape).
- Storyboarder upgraded sonnet-4-6 → opus-4-7 + revisionNote wired into prompt with hard-contract block.
- Sandy carry-over S14→S15 (image fields cloned, text canon for S15 preserved).
- `library-style-first-visual-generation-protocol` skill rewritten as reference example of process-flavor skill under new global meta-doc `~/.claude/rules/common/skill-creation.md`.
- Director name codified as **Александр** in cross-project memory after I twice hallucinated «Кирилл».

