## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **factory.ts logEvent refactor** (commit `b6c83e7`) — confirmed: 3 inline `activity_events.insert` sites at lines 196 (agent_started), 391 (agent_completed), 471 (agent_failed) now go through `logEvent`. Helper itself fires `pa/notify-needed` Inngest event when `isActionableEventType(input.event_type)` returns true.
- **Synthetic auto-react smoke** (multiple curls during session) — confirmed: `POST http://localhost:8288/e/test` with `{name: 'sandystudio/pa/notify-needed', data: {threadId, source, triggerId}}` produces a real `concierge_turns role=assistant metadata.auto_react=true` row within 6-15s.
- **Drive layout migration** — 13/13 S15 SBL-* files moved into `SandyStudio/SS-S15/bible/images/` (Drive folder id `1Kdu07_uCfvgGPdapUizPH_alR29Ool0Q`). Sandy carry-over (drive_file_id `1OVgRCnW...`) skipped correctly because shared with S14 LOCKED. drive_file_id preserved across move (Supabase rows unchanged).
- **Sandy S14→S15 carry-over** — direct REST PATCH executed with Director's «PATCH OK». staging_path + drive_path + drive_file_id + drive_web_view_url cloned from S14 v02 LOCKED into S15 v01 DRAFT. metadata.cloned_from_asset_id + clone_trace stamped. Then re-PATCH to set drive_path to browser-loadable staging URL (was Drive viewer URL which `<img>` couldn't render).
- **Storyboarder revisionNote wired** (commits `da31f81` + `fd991bf`) — confirmed via diff:
  - `StoryboarderRunArgs.revisionNote?: string` added
  - `buildUserMessage` accepts + renders new «REVISION NOTE — HARD CONTRACT FROM DIRECTOR» block
  - `runner.ts:462` EXEC-SB case now forwards `args.revisionNote` to runner
  - `SB_MODEL = 'claude-opus-4-7'` (was sonnet-4-6)
  - Registry `EXEC-SB.model = 'opus'` for descriptive consistency
- **Bible aspect-ratio policy** (commit `d1cc216`) — `lib/api/bible-image-size.ts` helper, applied in bible-author / bible/generate-image / regenerate-image SBL branch. Sections: character/object → `1024×1024`; location/style → `1536×1024`.
- **Verify trio** at session end: `npx tsc --noEmit` clean · `npx vitest run` 327/327 · `npm run replay-pilot` 29/29.
- **PLAN.md CURRENT STATE updated** with all 19 commits + verify numbers.
- **Drive folder layout verified** by Director ("файлы на местах!") immediately after migration ran.

